1 to 2025, 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. August to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, October to November came in at 52% of normal and September to October at 61%. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1963, at 68% to 69% of normal.</p>"}
